          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-20619 tests: cleanup leftover mounts",
        "message": "LU-20619 tests: cleanup leftover mounts\n\nWhen a test fails and doesn't unmount what it just mounted, that could\nlead to a busy error when we try to unconfigure lnet in reinit_dlc.\nThis patch ensures we don't have mounted targets by calling\n\"cleanupall -f\".\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nSigned-off-by: Cyril Bordage <cbordage@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I4d90878e91abf05d882cd82c87b9b2585bbd91df\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
